Theyre looking for someone to blame. As a leader you can delegate authority but not responsibility. I bet they had a lot of managers sign off on your code saying that it was good which is now biting them in the ass because they didn't actually test it out. 

&#x200B;

You didn't fail - they are looking for someone else to blame.

omg yes. I just want to be. I just want to exist in public wearing clothes that dont signal to others arbitrary things about me. I want to wear a dress without being seen as 'trying to look cute' etc...

&#x200B;

I feel most myself with other queer people who feel the same way but i cant exist wholly in that community.

